From 5fd8ae00d88513e674400f687516cadaaabae578 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:37:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign Couple Level page to match the new reference

New crimson-glass layout: XP ring + progress bar, next-unlock card, locked
and earned badge sections, and a 2-column "How to earn XP" guide. XP and
badge logic are unchanged. Dedicated level.css, responsive from small
phones to large monitors (two columns from 1200px), keyboard focus and
reduced-motion support.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J7u1vdgcUJye1Mc5hbexAK
